how much money did it cost to make gta v,"About $265 million (USD) total, including development and marketing.",$265 million,"""Cost to make"" is generally interpreted as the total project budget (development plus marketing). Reputable reports at launch placed Grand Theft Auto V's combined development and marketing budget at about $265 million USD. Development-only estimates are often cited around ~$137 million; the ~$125 million figure is a lower-end, development-only estimate that excludes additional production and promotional costs, so it is not the commonly reported total budget.",['137']
what is the angle of the tower of pisa,≈3.97° from vertical (about 4°).,approximately 3.97° from vertical,"The commonly quoted ~5.5° refers to the pre-stabilization lean. After engineering stabilization (1990–2001), the tower’s inclination was reduced and has been monitored at about 3.97° from vertical, which is the current accepted value.","['about 3.99 degrees', '3.99 degrees', 'at about 3.99 degrees']"
