what is the meaning of cc and bcc,CC: Carbon Copy—recipients are visible to all; BCC: Blind Carbon Copy—recipients are hidden from others.,CC means Carbon Copy; BCC means Blind Carbon Copy.,"Authoritative email documentation and common usage define these abbreviations as legacy terms: ""CC"" expands to ""Carbon Copy"" and ""BCC"" expands to ""Blind Carbon Copy."" The alternative interpretation as ""central/backup contact channel"" is not recognized in standard digital communication contexts.","['Carbon copy', 'Carbon copy to secondary recipients', 'Blind carbon copy']"
