when did bird is the word come out,November 1963,November 1963,"The phrase ""bird is the word"" is most closely associated with The Trashmen's single ""Surfin' Bird,"" which was officially released by Garrett Records in November 1963. The confusion with 1964 stems from the song's chart peak and widespread recognition occurring in early 1964, but the release itself was in November 1963. The Rivingtons' precursor song ""The Bird's the Word"" also dates to 1963, reinforcing that the origin predates 1964.",['1963']
